This repository redistributes test fixtures of Apache PLC4X under the Apache
License, Version 2.0: the four unmodified XML files under fixtures/modbus/upstream/,
taken from Apache PLC4X v1.0.0 (commit ea229918f5d07700e04d7d69ab1645da679cb700),
and the six Modbus TCP frames in fixtures/modbus/tcp/adu_upstream-*.hex, which are
copied from the <raw> elements of one of those files. Each XML file keeps its ASF
license header. fixtures/modbus/PROVENANCE.toml records the origin of every file and
vector. These fixtures are not part of the published stonecrab crate.

This repository also redistributes one Apache PLC4X protocol description under the
Apache License, Version 2.0: upstream/mspec/modbus/modbus.mspec, an unmodified copy of
protocols/modbus/src/main/resources/protocols/modbus/modbus.mspec from the same commit,
with its ASF license header kept. upstream/manifest.toml records its upstream path, git
blob and sha256. tools/stonecrab-codegen reads it to generate Rust code, and the generated
files under crates/stonecrab/src/modbus/generated/ name it in their headers. The mspec
itself is not part of the published stonecrab crate.

